WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.130
Every soul shall have a taste
of death, says the Qur'an.

2
00:00:04.180 --> 00:00:07.240
Muslims believe each person has one life.

3
00:00:07.290 --> 00:00:09.040
There is no rebirth.

4
00:00:09.090 --> 00:00:11.650
The Qur'an calls this life a test.

5
00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:13.370
But a test for what?

6
00:00:13.420 --> 00:00:16.480
So what do Muslims believe
happens after death?

7
00:00:16.530 --> 00:00:18.580
And why should it matter now?

8
00:00:18.630 --> 00:00:21.340
In this mission, you'll follow
the journey of the soul,

9
00:00:21.390 --> 00:00:25.560
frame by frame, into the
akhirah, the hereafter.

10
00:00:25.610 --> 00:00:29.810
Then you'll explore what Muslims
believe about paradise and hell.

11
00:00:29.860 --> 00:00:33.990
Your mission: find out what Muslims
believe happens after death,

12
00:00:34.040 --> 00:00:35.550
and why it matters now.
